cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Zero45, please cite it as below. Please also cite the original game “Path to Zero” and the data sources (see DATA_SOURCES.md)."
type: software
title: "Zero45 – Energy transition planning game (Germany 2030–2045)"
abstract: >-
  A planning game for groups: in four stages, teams build an electricity system for Germany that is reliable,
  climate-neutral and affordable. Each stage is simulated hour by hour with an electricity market model
  (PyPSA + HiGHS) using TYNDP 2024 and Bundesnetzagentur data. German and English user interface.
  Based on the game idea of “Path to Zero” (Princeton ZERO Lab).
authors:
  - family-names: Lerschmacher
    given-names: Manuel
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/M4nule/Energiewendespiel   
